WEBVTT

00:00:03.179 --> 00:00:06.110
Open Interaction Center, My workspace.

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.974
At the top are your name, your presence button, and the connection.

00:00:10.974 --> 00:00:13.639
Connected means live updates work.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:17.596
Signed in to lists the queues you are signed in to, and how

00:00:17.596 --> 00:00:21.636
many items are waiting in each, so you can see where the pressure is.

00:00:22.089 --> 00:00:25.910
Active interaction shows the call or message you are working.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.129
It says No active interactions right now until you accept something.

00:00:30.582 --> 00:00:36.722
Recent activity lists the interactions you finished most recently, with the outcome and the talk time.

